{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00273",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.98,
      "end_seconds": 4.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor, the receptionist said you'd see me now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.54,
      "end_seconds": 8.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Right, yes, do sit. Tell me what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 9.76,
      "end_seconds": 14.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Oh, um, thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.33,
      "end_seconds": 18.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 19.54,
      "end_seconds": 25.63,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "Doctor, it's numbness on the left side of my face. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.37,
      "end_seconds": 28.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.04,
      "end_seconds": 36.68,
      "duration_seconds": 6.64,
      "text": "Yesterday, it came on out of nowhere. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.23,
      "end_seconds": 40.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Does it happen all the time or in spells?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.48,
      "end_seconds": 48.98,
      "duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "text": "It, It happens all the time. And there's a slight slur in my speech as well, ten days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.61,
      "end_seconds": 52.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "On a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.05,
      "end_seconds": 62.59,
      "duration_seconds": 9.54,
      "text": "A three out of ten, I suppose. And there's headache as well, about a week now. Right, there's tiredness as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.51,
      "end_seconds": 67.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.08,
      "end_seconds": 68.82,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.13,
      "end_seconds": 86.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Right, and palpitations, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.06,
      "end_seconds": 89.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Hmm, not at all, no palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 90.39,
      "end_seconds": 94.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Yeah, actually, doctor, I did notice palpitations. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.37,
      "end_seconds": 102.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "Yeah, no, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.86,
      "end_seconds": 108.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. And chest pain, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.85,
      "end_seconds": 113.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.5,
      "end_seconds": 117.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Have you had any fall, trouble swallowing or loss of vision?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.55,
      "end_seconds": 122.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "No, no fall, trouble swallowing or loss of vision."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.94,
      "end_seconds": 125.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.66,
      "end_seconds": 127.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.02,
      "end_seconds": 129.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.23,
      "end_seconds": 131.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.41,
      "end_seconds": 147.36,
      "duration_seconds": 13.95,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.92,
      "end_seconds": 152.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Well, good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.88,
      "end_seconds": 157.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.14,
      "end_seconds": 170.96,
      "duration_seconds": 12.82,
      "text": "An irregular heartbeat, for about ten years. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit. Yes, diabetes. I did try to ignore it for a while. I have high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.38,
      "end_seconds": 180.63,
      "duration_seconds": 9.25,
      "text": "Okay, diabetes, that's already on your record. Good to know. Let's go through your medication. What are you taking? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.54,
      "end_seconds": 185.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "I'm on apixaban, 5 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 186.1,
      "end_seconds": 193.21,
      "duration_seconds": 7.11,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the apixaban was 10 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.19,
      "end_seconds": 198.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Hm, that's different. Is the latest prescription anywhere near you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.42,
      "end_seconds": 211.45,
      "duration_seconds": 12.03,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me. Right, it's Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar. Atorvastatin. I take it 20 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.65,
      "end_seconds": 215.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.63,
      "end_seconds": 217.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "Six months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.32,
      "end_seconds": 223.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.65,
      "end_seconds": 228.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "So, yes, eggs, it gives me a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.43,
      "end_seconds": 232.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.16,
      "end_seconds": 234.01,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.28,
      "end_seconds": 250.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. So, what about operations, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.45,
      "end_seconds": 254.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Just cataract surgery on my right eye, last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.66,
      "end_seconds": 258.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.74,
      "end_seconds": 269.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.95,
      "end_seconds": 293.84,
      "duration_seconds": 7.89,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.7 degrees, oxygen saturation is 97 percent. And BP is 148 over 97, pulse is 74 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.98,
      "end_seconds": 296.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.61,
      "end_seconds": 301.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.59,
      "end_seconds": 308.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.0,
      "end_seconds": 314.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.86,
      "end_seconds": 319.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Alright, tell me if anything hurts as I press."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.33,
      "end_seconds": 329.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Grip strength is a little weaker on the left."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.51,
      "end_seconds": 333.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Okay, open wide for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.32,
      "end_seconds": 352.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "There's mild drooping at the left corner of your mouth."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.11,
      "end_seconds": 375.99,
      "duration_seconds": 18.88,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Putting it all together, this looks most like a possible mini-stroke, which we need to investigate urgently. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. It could also be a pinched nerve, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 377.08,
      "end_seconds": 378.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.1,
      "end_seconds": 397.18,
      "duration_seconds": 17.08,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a possible mini-stroke, which we need to investigate urgently, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had numbness on the left side of your face, yesterday, and no fall."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 398.32,
      "end_seconds": 399.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 400.39,
      "end_seconds": 414.55,
      "duration_seconds": 14.16,
      "text": "I'm going to order a carotid scan, for possible stroke. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. I'm going to order an ECG, for possible stroke. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 415.61,
      "end_seconds": 416.55,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 416.95,
      "end_seconds": 426.55,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "I'm prescribing clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day, until we review. That should help with stroke prevention. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 428.15,
      "end_seconds": 431.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Well, alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 432.02,
      "end_seconds": 450.13,
      "duration_seconds": 18.11,
      "text": "Don't drive for now, and bring someone with you to the next visit. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 451.54,
      "end_seconds": 453.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 454.24,
      "end_seconds": 463.26,
      "duration_seconds": 9.02,
      "text": "If the numbness, weakness or speech problem returns, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Let's review you in one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 464.02,
      "end_seconds": 466.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Okay, so okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 467.7,
      "end_seconds": 474.45,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 475.96,
      "end_seconds": 483.66,
      "duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "text": "So, I take the clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day and come back in one week. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 484.49,
      "end_seconds": 488.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Take care, and don't hesitate to call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 489.95,
      "end_seconds": 491.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Alright, thanks. Bye for now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 492.81,
      "end_seconds": 495.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}